flowchart LR
  accTitle: Independent evidence-relation and migration-depth codes
  accDescr: Fan and Lan's coding keeps evidence relation and migration depth separate. E3 means a functionally convergent mechanism without a documented inheritance claim. D4 means outcome-dependent adaptation of future control. The GraSP B5 mapping is E3/D4. Neither axis implies the other, and neither code alone proves complete historical migration or universal correctness.
  M[GraSP mechanism mapping] --> E[E3: functional convergence]
  M --> D[D4: experience-adaptive future control]
  E --> N[No documented lineage inferred]
  D --> F[No complete migration inferred]
  N --> B[Read as two independent axes]
  F --> B
  B --> C[Bounded E3 / D4 claim]
  classDef source fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E
  classDef process fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E
  classDef output fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E
  classDef caution fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#1C1C1E
  class M source
  class E,D,N,F,B process
  class C output
